### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create tenant (UUID is generated by PostgreSQL)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tenant A"
}

### Create message (replace TENANT_UUID with id from create tenant response)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant-id: TENANT_UUID

{
  "tenantId": "TENANT_UUID",
  "conversationId": "conv-100",
  "to": "+919876543210",
  "text": "Your Order has shipped"
}

### Get message (replace MESSAGE_UUID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/messages/MESSAGE_UUID
x-tenant-id: TENANT_UUID

### List conversation messages
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/conversations/conv-100/messages?limit=20
x-tenant-id: TENANT_UUID

### Provider webhook
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-001",
  "messageId": "MESSAGE_UUID",
  "status": "DELIVERED",
  "occurredAt": "2026-10-16T08:30:00.000Z"
}
